@title Heat on an empty cabinet that cannot simulate shows no temperatures
@area Cabinet
# Edge test E-2: a cabinet with no size and no devices showed "46 °C, +5 K" hot-spot cards beside "Cannot simulate".
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 15
click_text "New cabinet..."
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 15
shot cabinet-empty
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text show or hide heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 15
shot heat-preview
click_text Simulate #2
wait 10
shot heat-empty
expect "Cannot simulate"
# The hot-spot cards are painted text, not widgets, so the picture (heat-empty) shows they are gone.
